\title{Functional extensionality via generalized element}
\taxon{Exercise}
\author{hsuchingchung}
\date{2026-10-30T13:33:39Z}
\import{macros-subobj}

\p{

Let #{f, g : A \r B} be two morphisms in a category \CCat. Show that #{f = g} if and only if #{f x = g x} for all [generalized element](0002) #{x} of #{A}.

}
